{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.Descartes","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.Descartes","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.brings_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.brings_euler","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L88-L90","doc":"Bring's surface has Euler characteristic -6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.brings_genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.brings_genus","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L84-L86","doc":"Bring's surface has genus 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.descartes_terminal_genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.descartes_terminal_genus","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L68-L82","doc":"**Terminality criterion**: Bring's surface is terminal in C_{-6} because\nit is the unique genus-4 curve with automorphism group S₅.\n\nFor any Descartes universe D, the genus is forced to be 4\n(by genus_eq_four), and the S₅ symmetry of Bring's curve\nmeans there is a unique morphism D → Bring's QOU preserving χ.\n\nWe encode uniqueness as: any two Descartes universes with the same\nEuler characteristic have the same genus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.brings_hurwitz_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.brings_hurwitz_bound","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L64-L66","doc":"The Hurwitz bound for Bring's surface: 120 ≤ 84 × (4 - 1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.brings_aut_order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.brings_aut_order","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L55-L62","doc":"Bring's surface has the maximal automorphism group among genus-4 curves.\n|Aut(Σ₄)| = 120 = |S₅|.\n\nThe Hurwitz bound gives |Aut| ≤ 84(g-1) = 252 for g = 4.\nBring's surface achieves |Aut| = 120, which is the maximum\nthat actually occurs for genus 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.bringsSurface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.bringsSurface","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L44-L53","doc":"**Bring's surface** as a Descartes universe: genus 4, |Aut| = 120 = |S₅|.\nThis is the terminal object in C_{-6}.\n\nRef: [leitner2026] Chapter 6, §Descartes theorem ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.genus_eq_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.genus_eq_four","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L36-L42","doc":"Any Descartes universe has genus 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.autOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.autOrder","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Order of the automorphism group |Aut(Σ)|. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.gauss_bonnet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.gauss_bonnet","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Gauss-Bonnet: 2(1 - g) = χ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.genus","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Genus of the base Riemann surface. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.euler_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.euler_eq","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Descartes condition: χ = -6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.eulerChar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.eulerChar","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Euler characteristic χ(A) = tr(id_A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse.mk","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DescartesUniverse","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean#L19-L34","doc":"**Descartes universe data**: a QOU satisfying the Descartes condition\nχ(A) = -6 together with its geometric invariants.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{thm:descartes}`\nRef: [leitner2026] Chapter 6, §Descartes theorem ","signatureChunk":0}]}